1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,170
Imagine going camping in the forest with your friends for the weekend.

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:08,910
You just want to relax, set up a tent, and spend a night under the stars.

3
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:13,890
But you have no idea that this forest is about to become your trap.

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,190
On the first evening, everything seems normal.

5
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:25,190
You're sitting around the campfire, talking and laughing.

6
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:29,710
Suddenly, your friend notices a tall figure standing between the trees.

7
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,650
It's so tall that it almost reaches the treetops.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,180
You point your flashlight toward it.

9
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:41,160
But the next second, the figure disappears.

10
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:44,700
You decide it was just a trick of the shadows and go to sleep.

11
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:50,310
Around midnight, you wake up because of a strange sound.

12
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,010
Three slow footsteps.

13
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,650
Then silence.

14
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,870
And three more footsteps.

15
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:05,230
You carefully open the tent and look outside.

16
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:08,310
The same figure is standing in the clearing.

17
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:11,730
Tall, thin, wearing a black suit.

18
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,190
But there's something even stranger.

19
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,910
It has no face.

20
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,730
You quickly wake your friends.

21
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:25,110
But when they rush outside, the figure is already gone.

22
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:29,550
In the morning, you decide to leave the forest immediately.

23
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:32,630
But the road you used to get here has disappeared.

24
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:35,810
Everywhere you look, there are identical trees.

25
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:42,270
You start searching for an exit until you notice a strange message carved into a tree.

26
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,130
“Do not look back.”

27
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:47,510
At that moment, your phone vibrates.

28
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:50,430
A message appears from an unknown sender.

29
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,130
“I can see you all.”

30
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:57,010
You raise your head and look between the trees.

31
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:00,390
Three identical figures are standing there.

32
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:03,370
But one of them is much closer than the others.

33
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:06,390
Suddenly, your friend whispers:

34
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:08,890
“Wait… where is the fourth one?”

35
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:11,010
You turn around.

36
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:13,270
But the tent is already empty.

37
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,530
Where do you think your friend disappeared?

